===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|topf}}, from (western) {{inh|de|goh|*topf}}, {{m|goh|*tupf}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*duppaz|t=hollow, bowl}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*dʰewb-|t=deep, hollow}}. Related to {{cog|gml|doppe|t=bowl, pot}}, {{cog|en|dop|t=a cup in which a diamond is cut}}, {{cog|nl|dop|t=a little cup, a thimble}}.

